{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/InstantiateMVarsS.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.instantiateAssignedMVarHeadS?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">instantiateAssignedMVarHeadS?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">SymM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If the head of `e` is a metavariable that `instantiateMVars` replaces, returns `e` with the head\nreplaced by its value and beta-reduced, and `none` otherwise. The arguments of `e` are not\ntraversed.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/InstantiateMVarsS.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.instantiateAssignedMVarHeadS?","kind":"def","line":32,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.instantiateAssignedMVarHeadS?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/InstantiateMVarsS.lean#L32-L50"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/InstantiateMVarsS.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.instantiateMVarsIfMVarAppS\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">instantiateMVarsIfMVarAppS</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">SymM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Head-only variant of `instantiateMVarsS`: instantiates and reshares only when the head of `e` is a\nmetavariable, otherwise returns `e` unchanged.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/InstantiateMVarsS.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.instantiateMVarsIfMVarAppS","kind":"def","line":22,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.instantiateMVarsIfMVarAppS","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/InstantiateMVarsS.lean#L22-L30"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/InstantiateMVarsS.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.instantiateMVarsS\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">instantiateMVarsS</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">SymM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Instantiates metavariables occurring in `e`, and returns a maximally shared term.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/InstantiateMVarsS.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.instantiateMVarsS","kind":"def","line":12,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.instantiateMVarsS","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/InstantiateMVarsS.lean#L12-L20"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Sym.InstantiateS","Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.InstantiateMVarsS"}